* ==================================================================
* IBM MQ Cluster Setup Script for Queue Manager: QM7
* Role: FULL REPOSITORY (FR)
* Target Cluster: CLUST3
* ==================================================================

* 1. Configure TCP Listener
DEFINE LISTENER('LISTENER.1414') TRPTYPE(TCP) PORT(1414) CONTROL(QMGR) REPLACE
START LISTENER('LISTENER.1414')

* 2. Designate this Queue Manager as a Full Repository
ALTER QMGR REPOS('CLUST3')

* 3. Cluster-Receiver Channel (CLUSRCVR)
* Allows all cluster members to send cluster information and messages to QM7
DEFINE CHANNEL('TO.QM7') +
       CHLTYPE(CLUSRCVR) +
       TRPTYPE(TCP) +
       CONNAME('localhost(1414)') +
       CLUSTER('CLUST3') +
       DESCR('Cluster receiver channel for QM7') +
       REPLACE

* 4. Initial Cluster-Sender Channel(s) (CLUSSDR)
* Used for initial cluster registration and discovery
* [NOTICE] No CLUSSDR targets specified for this Queue Manager.

* 5. Define Cluster Queues
* Workload balancing is enabled using DEFBIND(NOTFIXED)
DEFINE QLOCAL('Q8') +
       CLUSTER('CLUST3') +
       DEFBIND(NOTFIXED) +
       DESCR('Cluster workload-balanced queue for CLUST3') +
       REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('Q7') +
       CLUSTER('CLUST3') +
       DEFBIND(NOTFIXED) +
       DESCR('Cluster workload-balanced queue for CLUST3') +
       REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('Q6') +
       CLUSTER('CLUST3') +
       DEFBIND(NOTFIXED) +
       DESCR('Cluster workload-balanced queue for CLUST3') +
       REPLACE
DEFINE QLOCAL('Q9') +
       CLUSTER('CLUST3') +
       DEFBIND(NOTFIXED) +
       DESCR('Cluster workload-balanced queue for CLUST3') +
       REPLACE
